# Normalise line endings: LF in the repository AND LF in the working tree.
# Contributors on Windows commonly run core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites the
# checkout to CRLF; Prettier (endOfLine: "lf") then flags every untouched file
# as dirty and the lint-staged pre-commit hook (`prettier --write`) sweeps that
# pure-format noise into unrelated commits. `eol=lf` here overrides autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
